"P752567914" "{HeroName}.<br><br>I tell you this isn't about fame and glory, and what do you do? You hog both, and now I'm being ordered by Praetor White to set up an <i>induction</i> ceremony for you?! I swear, this is the most ridiculous thing ever.<br><br>You don't even do anything!<br><br>Well, if it's a ceremony that the big boss wants, it's a ceremony that he'll get."

