// Dialog - ReeseDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2568052397" "You think you got what it takes, {HeroName}? They got a whole little arena set up for your final bout in the Magisterium. Not that I think it's a good idea - people shouldn't be there to see Riptide rip you to shreds. But Praetor White seems fine with it."
// Answer Text :
"P2252187870" "This is me laughing, Reese. Ha ha ha. I'm ready to go."

