// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3377071642" "I've been told to tell you what exactly the Induction Ceremony is.<br><br>It's not easy rising to power and fame - power in the division.<br><br>When someone catches our eye, we run 'em through a series of fights with our toughest members.<br><br>I don't need to participate in it anymore, of course. They ruled it unfair after I kept wiping the floor with all of our inductees.<br><br>White ordered me to set one up, so I set one up.<br><br>On the off chance you make it through this, White is putting you on par with me. You're not <i>better</i> than me, mind you, just on the same level. On <i>paper</i>."
// AcceptString :
"P3012548894" "Right, on paper. So who's up first?"
// SendOffString :
"P1474588509" "Your first, and last opponent, is going to be Stern. If Stern is having an off day and somehow you <i>win</i>, you're fighting that little pal of yours, Warrant.<br><br>You'll probably beat Warrant since he's a little...<br><br>Ahem. If you past Warrant, we have the final rounds taking place in the heart of the Magisterium.<br><br>I kind of hope you make it that far - at least then <i>everyone</i> will see how you're full of hot air when you fall down in the shadow of Cole's tower."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2591949095" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: A Spectacle for the Crowd</color>"

