"P1377764852" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SteelBlue>And here now is {HeroName}, looking to prove {Hero.gender=male himself|herself} against Praetor White's Top Dogs!<t=5 caption x= 0.8 y=0.2  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SteelBlue>Can {HeroName} defeat Riptide, Aria, AND Zane? Let's find out!"
